      "widgets_values": [
        "1 MP / 40 steps. Load all four image nodes. Node 1: source with generation mask. Node 2: full target garment. Node 20: detail crop of SAME reference (or repeat full reference). Node 21: SAME source/crop and dimensions, with a separate blend mask. Use MaskEditor: plain RGB black/white mask files do not supply LoadImage alpha masks. Cover old and intended new garment silhouette; exclude hands/face where possible. Target reference controls dress length. Prepare tight source crops manually; no automatic crop/stitch or repair pass. Carefully inpaint boundaries and review details. Exact garment reproduction is not guaranteed. README preview is retouched, not raw workflow output."
